== Splash Wave Pool special_hours
- UNPARSED freeform "The air heater at our facility is not working. The building may feel colder than usual."
    phrase: "The air heater at our facility is not working"
    at: facility
- NOTICE "The lap pool heater is out of order, the water will feel colder."
    match: NONE
    phrase: "The lap pool heater is out of order, the water will feel colder"
    amenity: "lap pool"
    at: facility
